Lucas grew up looking out for his younger sister, but were separated when their parents' house was burnt down by [[Kiel]] and his [[Casterwill Hunters]]. Sophie was rescued by her bodyguard [[Santiago]] but Lucas was believed to be dead. However, he had, in fact, survived. {{source|Chasing Void}}

Lucas Casterwill kept his existence secret, leading his sister, [[Sophie Casterwill]], to believe he had died in the fire just as he, himself, had believed her to be dead prior to her joining the [[Huntik Foundation]]. A year after finding out she was still alive, Lucas and his team, [[Dellix]] and [[Lane]], attacked her and the Huntik team in the [[Casterwill Library]] in Paris, in a bid to stop them pursuing the family's secrets, for her own safety. He revealed his identity before revealing that his team needed to recover the evil [[Amulet]] of [[Void]]. {{source|Chasing Void}} 

At the Casterwill meeting at the [[Fortress of Iron Will]], Lucas was against fighting openly against the [[Blood Spiral Brotherhood]]. When Sophie challenged, he tested her with the Trial of Courage, a dangerous quest that he himself had failed. {{source|Sophie on Trial}} When Sophie returned with the [[Legendary Titan]] of Bravery, [[Mythras]], Lucas remained skeptical. His views changed when he saw her hold her own in the battle with [[Kiel]] and give Mythras to [[Vivian Casterwill]]. He then decided to put his faith in her as the leader of the family. {{source|The Spiral War}}

On the longest night of the year, Lucas travelled with his team to the [[Spiral Mark]] in the [[Scramjet]]s. {{Source|The Spiral Mark}} As the battle ensued against the [[Blood Spiral]], Lucas was badly injured by [[Wind]]. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}} After being revived by [[Lady S.]] with her [[Everheal]] power, Lucas joined [[Sandra Lambert]] in the final battle against [[The Betrayer]]. However, he became petrified by [[the Betrayer|the Betrayer's]] [[Shadowlock]] power for a remainder of the conflict. After the Betrayer's defeat, he was released and seen celebrating with the rest of the Casterwills and the Foundation. {{Source|Dante's Return}}

